## Input

```mlk
// A function that declares one parameter name twice: the parameters of a function are what
// its body binds, and a name a body reads is one name, so the two cannot be told apart.

@builtin
type Int

fun same(left: Int, left: Int): Int =
    left

fun different(left: Int, right: Int): Int =
    left

```

